### 1. 管理员登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.data);
    client.log("管理员token: " + client.global.get("admin_token"));
%}

### 2. 测试管理员权限 - 应该成功
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 3. 查看待审核技能
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/skill/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 4. 审核技能通过（修改【技能ID】为实际ID）
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/skill/audit/1?status=1&remark=测试审核通过
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 5. 查看用户列表
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 6. 普通用户登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student1",
      "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("user_token", response.body.data);
    client.log("普通用户token: " + client.global.get("user_token"));
%}

### 7. 普通用户尝试访问管理员接口 - 应该失败 (403)
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}